摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"A plugin collection for DeepSeek Harness (DSH). Install this one bundle to get every plugin listed below; each plugin can also be installed on its own.","id":"gh:1427788427","install_available":true,"language":"TypeScript","name":"dsh-plugins","slug":"Mt-Youya/dsh-plugins","topics":["ai-agent","ai-agents","claude","claude-ai","claude-code","codex","dsh","dsh-bundle","dsh-plugin","dsh-plugin-desktop","dsh-plugin-market","dsh-plugins"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"A plugin collection for DeepSeek Harness (DSH). Install this one bundle to get every plugin listed b"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"elow; each plugin can also be installed on its own."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"English | 简体中文"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"# Cyrus Plugins · @cyrusdoyle/dsh-plugins"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"A plugin collection for DeepSeek Harness (DSH). Install this one bundle to get every plugin listed b"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"elow; each plugin can also be installed on its own."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"## Plugins"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"| Plugin                                                 | npm package                  | What it do"},{"id":"p6s2","text":"es                                                                                                  "},{"id":"p6s3","text":"                                |"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"| Sessions Insight | `@cyrusdoyle/dsh-sessions-insight` | Opens up what each turn of a Claude Code, "},{"id":"p7s2","text":"DSH or Codex session actually fed the model: composition, tool calls, compactions, cost. Includes co"},{"id":"p7s3","text":"nfirmed session deletion. |"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"Requires DSH 0.2.1-rc.5 or newer (see `docs/adr/0002-asar-021-is-the-contract.md`). First decide whi"},{"id":"p9s2","text":"ch profile to install into: the desktop app uses `desktop`, `dsh web` on the command line uses `web`"},{"id":"p9s3","text":". Installing into the wrong profile does not error; the plugin just never shows up."},{"id":"p10s1","text":"**Install the collection (recommended)** to get every plugin at once; when a plugin is added to the "},{"id":"p10s2","text":"collection later, upgrading the collection brings it in."},{"id":"p11s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"**Install a single plugin**:"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"Then **fully quit and reopen** DSH. \"Cyrus Plugins\" or \"Sessions Insight\" in the plugin manager mean"},{"id":"p14s2","text":" quit and reopen** DSH. \"Cyrus Plugins\" or \"Sessions Insight\" in the plugin manager means it worked."},{"id":"p15s1","text":"> **Pick one of the two.** The collection and the standalone plugin insert the same id into the load"},{"id":"p15s2","text":"er tree; with both in `dsh.profile.bundles`, DSH fails at boot with `duplicate loader entry id`. Run"},{"id":"p15s3","text":" `dsh plugin --profile <name> remove` on one before switching to the other.\n>\n> **Git installs work "},{"id":"p15s4","text":"for the standalone plugin, not for the collection.** `plugins/sessions-insight/lib/` is committed, s"},{"id":"p15s5","text":"o the member can be installed straight from this repository without running build scripts — for exam"},{"id":"p15s6","text":"ple `dsh plugin --profile desktop add github:Mt-Youya/dsh-plugins#path:/plugins/sessions-insight`, o"},{"id":"p15s7","text":"r point the plugin manager at a local checkout of that directory. The collection cannot be installed"},{"id":"p15s8","text":" from Git: its root `dependencies` use `workspace:^`, which is only rewritten to a version number by"},{"id":"p15s9","text":" `pnpm pack` / publish. Install the collection from npm, or link this checkout as described below."},{"id":"p16s1","text":"**Installing from this working tree (developing the collection)**: the desktop plugin manager's \"Add"},{"id":"p16s2","text":" plugin\" also accepts a local directory — point it at this checkout's absolute path. DSH records it "},{"id":"p16s3","text":"as `\"@cyrusdoyle/dsh-plugins\": \"link:<that path>\"`: a symlink into your working tree, not a copy, an"},{"id":"p16s4","text":"d nothing is built for you. The host resolves `lib/index.js` through that link, and `lib/` is gitign"},{"id":"p16s5","text":"ored, so build it first (the collection embeds the compiled stylesheet, so the CSS step comes first)"},{"id":"p16s6","text":"red, so build it first (the collection embeds the compiled stylesheet, so the CSS step comes first):"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"## Settings, balance and update checks"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"The collection embeds the same plugin source as the standalone member (ADR 0009), so its runtime beh"},{"id":"p20s2","text":"aviour is the Sessions Insight behaviour: read-only insight, the handoff, confirmed session deletion"},{"id":"p20s3","text":", plus a settings page and two opt-in utilities."},{"id":"p21s1","text":"- **Settings are saved by the Host.** `/api/dsh-sessions-insight/settings` is read-only; the six swi"},{"id":"p21s2","text":"tches (session overview, Skills tab, cumulative level chart, expand tools by default, balance displa"},{"id":"p21s3","text":"y, automatic version checks) are written through the Host's configuration form and stored by the Hos"},{"id":"p21s4","text":"t. The plugin writes no config file.\n- **Balance and version checks are off by default.** Turning on"},{"id":"p21s5","text":"e on — or pressing its button — is the only thing that makes the plugin call out. Outbound traffic i"},{"id":"p21s6","text":"s limited to two fixed HTTPS endpoints, `https://api.deepseek.com/user/balance` and `https://registr"},{"id":"p21s7","text":"y.npmjs.org/@cyrusdoyle%2F.../latest`, with no redirects, no cookies and no caller-controlled URL.\n-"},{"id":"p21s8","text":" **Credentials**: the balance check resolves the credential reference configured for the DeepSeek of"},{"id":"p21s9","text":"ficial adapter (`apiKeyEnv`, default `DEEPSEEK_API_KEY`), then falls back to the signed-in DeepSeek "},{"id":"p21s10","text":"account. Custom provider references are not followed; the plugin never stores or logs the key.\n- **T"},{"id":"p21s11","text":"he read surface never rewrites source logs.** The only writes are the handoff routes — `handoff/appl"},{"id":"p21s12","text":"y` delivers a brief through the official `session.create` + `session.prompt`, `handoff/reveal` creat"},{"id":"p21s13","text":"es or reuses a workspace so an existing DSH session is visible there — and confirmed session deletio"},{"id":"p21s14","text":"n. `/balance` additionally accepts loopback callers only, because the Host webserver has no site-wid"},{"id":"p21s15","text":"e auth.\n- **Requires DSH 0.2.1-rc.5+**: the settings page needs the `configForms` client service and"},{"id":"p21s16","text":" the `plugins.bundle.config` slot introduced in that version."},{"id":"p22s1","text":"The plugin README has the full route list, defaults and known limitations."},{"id":"p23s1","text":"## Repository layout"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"This is a pnpm monorepo. Only the collection and `plugins/*` are published; the rest is inlined into"},{"id":"p24s2","text":" the plugins at build time."},{"id":"p25s1","text":"| Path                         | Contents                                                           "},{"id":"p25s2","text":"       | Published                             |"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"| `/` (root)                   | The collection bundle: `cordis.patch.yml`, `locale/`, its own `lib/"},{"id":"p26s2","text":"`      | **yes**, `@cyrusdoyle/dsh-plugins`         |\n| `plugins/sessions-insight`    | The Sessions"},{"id":"p26s3","text":" Insight plugin: host half and browser half                       | **yes**, `@cyrusdoyle/dsh-sessio"},{"id":"p26s4","text":"ns-insight` |\n| `packages/session-contract`  | The unified IR, wire types and their guards          "},{"id":"p26s5","text":"                     | no                                    |\n| `packages/session-readers`   | Clau"},{"id":"p26s6","text":"de Code / Codex / DSH readers                                         | no                          "},{"id":"p26s7","text":"          |\n| `packages/plugin-kit`        | Plugin-agnostic JSON envelope and URL spelling         "},{"id":"p26s8","text":"                   | no                                    |\n| `packages/plugin-kit-host`   | Host-h"},{"id":"p26s9","text":"alf plumbing: route table, same-origin gate, envelope, LRU          | no                            "},{"id":"p26s10","text":"        |\n| `packages/plugin-kit-client` | Browser-half plumbing: decoding fetch, style injection, s"},{"id":"p26s11","text":"lot registration | no                                    |\n[该节后续省略]"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
